Open Gorton, by Dakota Felder, from https://github.com/dakotafelder/open-gorton
(commit 30094223a4f1e54e44ec3e2c39477f1b7e1006e4), under the MIT licence in LICENSE.

OpenGorton-Regular.woff2 is built from that repository's OpenGorton-Regular.otf by
tools/make-touch-keyboard-font.py, which cuts it down to printable ASCII less the
lowercase letters (which it maps to its capitals), makes its zero a slashed O, and
adds the BBC Micro function keys' f and cursor keys' arrows.
